{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch1tC2fGZ4SqPzLpV15Zv", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I signed off with 50% confidence after filing one bug, which the developer confirmed.\n\n**Bug:** with grouping set to By due date, Descending, Pay rent (due Dec 4) has no header of its own. It appears under \"No due date\", directly below Read docs. In Ascending order it sits correctly under \"Due Friday, December 4\".\n\n**What looked fine:**\n- **Date picker:** the shortcut times worked, and the 1 PM due and 9 AM start times were still there after saving.\n- **Row dates:** the start-date badge and due-time text on rows were correct.\n- **Group headers:** today, tomorrow, weekday names and full dates were all right.\n- **Subtasks:** nesting two levels deep used an even indent, and the child counts were correct.\n- **Repeating task:** completing Pay rent moved it to Jan 4, 2027, and Undo put it back on Dec 4.\n- **Rotation:** the list looked the same after rotating.\n\n**What I didn't verify:**\n- **Time shortcut settings:** I never changed the Morning/Afternoon/Evening/Night times, so I don't know whether the picker follows them. It showed the defaults.\n- **Show full date:** turning it on changed the editor to full dates but not the list row badges. I couldn't tell whether that is intended, so I didn't report it.\n- **Descending sort:** I tried it only briefly, and each group held a single task, so it showed nothing.\n\n**Test data left in the list:** I added Today task, Tomorrow task, Next task and a subtask called Cable. I set a start date on Buy milk and changed its due time to 1 PM. \"Show full date\" is still switched on, and I put Grouping back to Ascending but left Sorting on Descending."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 631, "cache_read_input_tokens": 207100, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 631}, "output_tokens": 569, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "143a4160-a471-4f6a-9dd1-b0736e492d66", "uuid": "630ad1f2-5a2c-48b4-9bc0-b0bf3aff35ee", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T00:35:43.359Z", "request_id": "req_011Ch1tC2S8XD8igjkT1jfvK"}
